  "items": [
    {
      "source": "If not specified, this accessor will try to retrieve a default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/Scheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>Scheduler</code></a>\nbean from the containing application context.",
      "translation": "如果未指定，此访问器将尝试从包含的应用程序上下文中检索默认的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/Scheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>Scheduler</code></a>  bean。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Schedulers can be registered in the repository through custom bootstrapping,\nfor example, via the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/impl/StdSchedulerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz.impl\"><code>StdSchedulerFactory</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/impl/DirectSchedulerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz.impl\"><code>DirectSchedulerFactory</code></a> factory classes.\nHowever, in general, it's preferable to use Spring's <a href=\"SchedulerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.quartz\"><code>SchedulerFactoryBean</code></a>\nwhich includes the job/trigger/listener capabilities of this accessor as well.",
      "translation": "调度器可以通过自定义引导在存储库中注册，例如通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/impl/StdSchedulerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz.impl\"><code>StdSchedulerFactory</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/impl/DirectSchedulerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz.impl\"><code>DirectSchedulerFactory</code></a> 工厂类。然而，通常更推荐使用 Spring 的 <a href=\"SchedulerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.quartz\"><code>SchedulerFactoryBean</code></a>，它同样包含此访问器的作业/触发器/监听器功能。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the Quartz Scheduler instance that this accessor operates on.",
      "translation": "返回该访问器操作的 Quartz Scheduler 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"SchedulerAccessor.html#getScheduler()\">getScheduler</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"SchedulerAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.quartz\">SchedulerAccessor</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"SchedulerAccessor.html#getScheduler()\">getScheduler</a></code>` 类中的 `<code><a href=\"SchedulerAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.quartz\">SchedulerAccessor</a></code>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after the population of normal bean properties\nbut before an initialization callback such as\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> or a custom init-method.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后，但在初始化回调（例如 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a>）或自定义 init-method 之前调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Compatible with Quartz 2.1.4 and higher.",
      "translation": "与 Quartz 2.1.4 及更高版本兼容。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows the bean instance to perform validation of its overall\nconfiguration and final initialization when all bean properties have been set.",
      "translation": "此方法允许 Bean 实例在其所有属性设置完成后，执行其整体配置验证和最终初始化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> after it has set all bean properties\nand satisfied <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>, <code>ApplicationContextAware</code> etc.",
      "translation": "由包含的<code>BeanFactory</code>在设置所有 bean 属性并满足<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>、<code>ApplicationContextAware</code>等接口后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Specify the Quartz <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/Scheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>Scheduler</code></a> to operate on via its scheduler name in the Spring\napplication context or also in the Quartz <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/impl/SchedulerRepository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz.impl\"><code>SchedulerRepository</code></a>.",
      "translation": "指定 Quartz <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/Scheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>Scheduler</code></a> 在 Spring 应用程序上下文中的调度程序名称进行操作，或者也在 Quartz <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/impl/SchedulerRepository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz.impl\"><code>SchedulerRepository</code></a> 中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">InitializingBean</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">InitializingBean</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Specify the Quartz <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/Scheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>Scheduler</code></a> instance to operate on.",
      "translation": "指定要操作的 Quartz <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/Scheduler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>Scheduler</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Callback that supplies the owning factory to a bean instance.",
      "translation": "向 Bean 实例提供其所属工厂的回调。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code>` 接口中的 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code>`",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - owning BeanFactory (never <code>null</code>).\nThe bean can immediately call methods on the factory.",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 拥有该 Bean 的 BeanFactory（永远不会为 <code>null</code>）。\n该 Bean 可以立即调用工厂上的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
